    "gm_notes": "<p>Long extinct on Earth, these hunting lizards often move in small packs and use their survival instincts to lay traps or track food. Those that evolve on other planets tend to have bright plumage that stands out from the environs. This beast was built by selecting a CR 7 Avian (2 claw attacks), fast three times and improved wisdom twice. It was then given keen sense, proficient, and tough twice to make it a CR 11.</p><p>Example beast, Core Rulebook pp.314-317.</p>",
